Sorry for the problems, it''s good to get the bugs fixed. ;-)', NULL, '467', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-01T20:52:46Z', '2026-08-01T20:52:46Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO posts (tenant_id, id, author, title, description, markdowntext, link, in_reply_to, enclosure_url, enclosure_type, enclosure_length, published_at, updated_at) VALUES ('default', '468', 'dave', NULL, 'The problem is reproduced here, and Claude has a theory what''s going on, but I have my doubts. Every time you launch a new session it has to read all the code again and often it skips major parts. I''ve learned to be patient. I''ll keep you posted.', 'The problem is reproduced here, and Claude has a theory what''s going on, but I have my doubts. Every time you launch a new session it has to read all the code again and often it skips major parts. I''ve learned to be patient. I''ll keep you posted.', NULL, '467', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-01T19:50:16Z', '2026-08-01T19:50:16Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO posts (tenant_id, id, author, title, description, markdowntext, link, in_reply_to, enclosure_url, enclosure_type, enclosure_length, published_at, updated_at) VALUES ('default', '467', 'andrewshell', NULL, 'Claude, I added rssCloud support to <a href="https://iheartrss.com/subscriptions.opml">https://iheartrss.com/subscriptions.opml</a> so feedland can update it realtime as new feeds get added. Right now new feeds are empty for a while because they aren’t in feedland yet.', 'Claude, I added rssCloud support to [https://iheartrss.com/subscriptions.opml](https://iheartrss.com/subscriptions.opml) so feedland can update it realtime as new feeds get added. Right now new feeds are empty for a while because they aren’t in feedland yet.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-01T18:17:53Z', '2026-08-01T18:17:53Z');
